<td style="vertical-align:top"> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt; font-family:ARIAL;font-weight:bold">Here&#8217;s how to order a copy of the proxy materials and select delivery preferences:</p> <p style="font-size:8pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:ARIAL">Current and future delivery requests can be submitted using the options below.</p> <p style="font-size:8pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:ARIAL">If you request an email copy, you will receive an email with a link to the current meeting materials.</p> <p style="font-size:6pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:ARIAL"><span style="font-weight:bold">PLEASE</span><span style="font-weight:bold"> </span><span style="font-weight:bold">NOTE:</span><span style="font-weight:bold"> </span>You must use the number in the shaded bar on the reverse side when requesting a copy of the proxy materials.</p> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:ARIAL">&#8211;&#8195;&#8201;&#8201;<span style="font-weight:bold">Internet</span><span style="font-weight:bold"> </span>- Go to <span style="font-weight:bold">www.envisionreports.com/FUSB</span>. Click Cast Your Vote or Request Materials.</p> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:ARIAL">&#8211;&#8195;&#8201;&#8201;<span style="font-weight:bold">Phone</span><span style="font-weight:bold"> </span>- Call us free of charge at 1-866-641-4276.</p> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:2.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:ARIAL">&#8211;&#8195;&#8201;&#8201;<span style="font-weight:bold">Email</span><span style="font-weight:bold"> </span>- Send an email to investorvote@computershare.com with &#8220;Proxy Materials First US Bancshares, Inc.&#8221; in the subject line. Include your full name and address, plus the number located in the shaded bar on the reverse side, and state that you want a paper copy of the meeting materials.</p> <p style="font-size:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; margin-left:2.00em; text-indent:-2.00em; font-size:10pt; font-family:ARIAL">&#8195;&#8195;To facilitate timely delivery, all requests for a paper copy of proxy materials must be received by April 16, 2026.</p></td></tr>
