<td style="vertical-align:middle;background-color:#dcddde"><span style="font-weight:bold">Authorized Signatures &#8211; This section must be completed for your vote to be counted. Date and sign below.</span></td></tr>
</table> <p style="margin-top:2pt; margin-bottom:0pt; margin-left:1%; margin-right:1%; font-size:8pt; font-family:ARIAL">When shares are held by joint tenants, both should sign. Executors, administrators, trustees, etc. should give full title as such. If the signer is a corporation, please sign full corporate name by duly authorized officer. If the signer is a partnership, limited liability company or other entity, please sign full entity name by authorized person. </p>
