<td style="BORDER-TOP:1.50pt solid #000000; BORDER-BOTTOM:1.50pt solid #000000;vertical-align:middle;background-color:#dcddde"> <p style="font-size:2pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p> <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:14pt; font-family:ARIAL;font-weight:bold">&#8194;REVOCABLE PROXY &#8211; FIRST US BANCSHARES, INC.</p> <p style="font-size:2pt; margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt">&#160;</p></td></tr>
</table> <p style="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
